## ✅ INTEGRATION REQUIREMENTS

### Billing - ALWAYS use BillingSystem:
```python
# CORRECT
billing_system.record_transaction(user_id, amount, description, type)

# WRONG - Never do direct Stripe calls
stripe.Charge.create(...)  # DON'T DO THIS
```

### Analytics - ALWAYS record significant events:
```python
# CORRECT
analytics_engine.record_event("event_type", user_id, {"key": "value"})

# Events to record:
# - sanctuary_created, sanctuary_member_joined, sanctuary_completed
# - login, registration, session_start
# - coaching_provided, message_sent
```

### Nevedal Metrics - Use MetricsEngine:
```python
# CORRECT
metrics_engine.load_metrics(profile)
metrics_engine.update_nevedal_state(profile, c_emo, p_ent, ...)

# Store in: Vaults/Clients/{id}/metrics.json
```

### Night School - Use existing RAG:
```python
# Wisdom stored in: Vaults/Admin/wisdom_database.json
# Use NightSchool class for training operations
```

